    "notes": "Compared with assets/external_l1j/monsters/1318.png and between both sheets: pale blue-gray hooded ghost, narrow face, clawed hands, torn robe and curled spectral tail retained. South shows face, north shows robe back; east/right and west/left reaches follow corresponding views. Three hover poses articulate robe and tail; contact extends arms, recoil and three collapse poses are distinct. 64+40 separated alpha bodies. Different sheet resolutions retain source pixels and use proportional canvas metadata. Earlier opaque-background hit/death sheet is rejected. In-game size, origin, AI, damage, death and loot still require validation."
  },
